        <param name="jnienv">The JNI environment pointer for the managed callback.</param>
        <param name="transition">On success, the active transition; otherwise, the default transition value.</param>
        <param name="runtime">On success, the current thread's runtime; otherwise, <see langword="null" />.</param>
        <summary>Attempts to enter a managed JNI callback and initialize its transition.</summary>
        <returns><see langword="true" /> if runtime entry and transition initialization succeed; otherwise, <see langword="false" />.</returns>
        <remarks>Entry calls the runtime's <c>OnEnterMarshalMethod</c> hook before it sets the environment pointer. Failures are written to standard error. A <see langword="false" /> result means the caller must not invoke the callback.</remarks>
